{"object":"fit among user, equipment, task and environment with user capabilities and limits.","predicate":"concerns","source_url":"http://localhost:8090/content/wikipedia_en_all_nopic/Ergonomics","subject":"ergonomics","text":"Ergonomics concerns interactions and fit among the user, equipment, task and environment while accounting for user capabilities and limitations. That framework requires matched user and workstation measurements; an ergonomic label or generic feature list is not a device-specific fit, posture or pain trial.","title":"prop_ergonomics_fit_scope"}